@page "/privacy"

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy · JAS International</PageTitle>

<div class="shop-container py-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600 block mb-2">DATA PROTECTION</span>
        <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Effective: 2026 · Committed to safeguarding customer confidentiality</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-xs space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>
                When you create an account, purchase products, or track shipments with JAS International, we collect the necessary contact details to fulfill your orders: your Full Name, Mobile Phone Number, Delivery Address (District, City, Street address), and Email Address.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">2. How Your Information Is Used</h2>
            <p>
                Your personal details are used strictly for:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
                <li>Processing and delivering your orders via authorized courier services.</li>
                <li>Sending SMS notifications and calling to verify COD deliveries.</li>
                <li>Managing customer warranty verification and repair history.</li>
                <li>Allowing account holders to manage saved delivery preferences.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">3. Data Security &amp; Sharing</h2>
            <p>
                We do not sell, rent, or lease customer data to third-party advertisers. Delivery addresses and phone numbers are securely transmitted only to contracted courier logistics providers for the sole purpose of parcel delivery. Password credentials are encrypted using industry-standard ASP.NET Core cryptographic hashing.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">4. Your Rights</h2>
            <p>
                You may review, update, or remove your profile information and saved addresses anytime directly from your <a href="/account" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold underline">Customer Account Portal</a>.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">5. Privacy Inquiries &amp; Data Requests</h2>
            <p>
                If you have questions regarding our privacy practices or wish to submit a data inquiry, please contact our support desk directly at <a href="mailto:info@jasinternational.com.bd" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold underline">info@jasinternational.com.bd</a> or phone <a href="tel:01711465078" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold underline">01711465078</a>.
            </p>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>
